+- **Opt-in bounded local outreach.** `prospecting.enabled` uses persisted free
+  TinyFish/OSM request budgets and ZeroBounce-only published-address verification.
+  Discovery rotates sector/place pairs; imports and backfill share website-quote
+  qualification, with eligibility reasons visible in Contacts and checked again
+  before the first send. Missing evidence or provider access waits for review.
+  Pilot sequences have exactly three steps at J+4/J+10 after the real first send,
+  separate first-contact and total daily limits, and a final business-window check
+  for replies too. The pilot writing mission identifies the assistant and permits
+  only the configured diagnostic-booking link, without changing disabled profiles.
+  `compliance.information_line` is included in the deterministic footer and preview.
+  French refusals and legal/commercial exceptions are handled before generation;
+  native reply effects and consumption commit atomically. Calendly GET snapshots
+  reconcile actual appointments, cancellations and reschedules; incomplete sync
+  holds cold outreach, and appointment states never imply a completed sale.
+
+- **Durable dashboard run intention.** Fresh installs stay stopped. Explicit Start
+  confirms the native PID/lock before enabling restart recovery; Stop disables
+  recovery before a shared asynchronous drain of up to thirty minutes. Dashboard
+  shutdown preserves intention, an owned-child crash exits nonzero for the
+  container supervisor, and external CLI loops are never duplicated or killed.
+  Controls/Today expose phase and last completed cycle separately from HTTP
+  availability; opt-in pilot work drains without the legacy cycle watchdog.
